The four columns of the first experiment run in their own sessions (code/pe_noext/run_noext_col.sh, 8 November), so
run_noext_pdet.sh does not launch them: the _Cw launchers exit when this file is in the checkout, unless NOEXT_COLS_HERE=1.
The rate they run at is results/noext_pdet/columns_pdet.txt, written by hand from the points of run_noext_pdet.sh and
run_noext_pdet_x.sh.
